:null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/890256652","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1292#issuecomment-890256652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1292","id":890256652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841ED0M","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-30T23:49:47Z","updated_at":"2021-07-30T23:49:47Z","body":"ok, so it looks like there are 3 variants (sigh)!\r\n- the one Fedora captured here: https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing:MIT?rd=Licensing/MIT#mpich2_variant - which SPDX added to the license list back in 2013/14 when adding a bunch of Fedora licenses. Looks like it's still in use, as I found it here: https://github.com/pmodels/mpich/blob/main/COPYRIGHT (but we should probably add some markup for the authors section)\r\n- this version, which is just the permission and disclaimer parts: https://sources.debian.org/src/openmpi/4.1.0-10/ompi/debuggers/msgq_interface.h/?hl=19#L19\r\n- and then the permission statement only variant: https://sources.debian.org/src/armci-mpi/0.3.1~beta-1/COPYRIGHT/?hl=11#L11\r\n\r\nIs the code under these license variants the kind of thing that is probably in all Linux distros? (if you have any idea about that)\r\n\r\n(Reason I ask, is Fedora is looking at adopting SPDX identifiers and one of the potential challenges is the possibility of a lot of stuff like this - old permissive licenses with lots of little variations that SPDX wouldn't call a match)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/890256652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/890256824","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1292#issuecomment-890256824","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1292","id":890256824,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841ED24","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-30T23:50:42Z","updated