n":false},"created_at":"2022-05-08T21:49:06Z","updated_at":"2022-05-08T21:49:06Z","body":"No PR yet; moving to next release","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1120492552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1120744258","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1292#issuecomment-1120744258","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1292","id":1120744258,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85CzTNC","user":{"login":"pombredanne","id":675997,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NTk5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/675997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne","html_url":"https://github.com/pombredanne","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-05-09T07:29:43Z","updated_at":"2022-05-09T07:29:43Z","body":"@jlovejoy sorry for missing to see and reply to your pings!\r\n\r\nHere is how the latest scancode detects these:\r\n \r\n- both detected as full text of `mpich2` \r\n  - https://github.com/pmodels/mpich/blob/main/COPYRIGHT\r\n    - See the scan details [COPYRIGHT.scancode.yml.txt](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/files/8649444/COPYRIGHT.scancode.yml.txt)\r\n  - https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing:MIT?rd=Licensing/MIT#mpich2_variant   \r\n    - See the scan details  [mpich2_variant.scancode.yml.txt](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/files/8649447/mpich2_variant.scancode.yml.txt)\r\n\r\n  \r\n- detected partially as the beginning of `mpich2` from L2 to L15 and then as a `BSD-3-Clause-Open-MPI` full text afterwards\r\n  - https://sources.debian.org/src/armci-mpi/0.3.1~beta-1/COPYRIGHT/?hl=11#L11\r\n    - See the scan details [COPYRIGHT.1.scancode.yml.txt](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/files/8649437/COPYRIGHT.1.scancode.yml.txt)\r\n\r\n- detected (twice) as a rarer, not-yet-named \"other permissive\" license https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/rules/other-permissive_327.RULE .... I guess this is seen frequently enough from its use in various MPI tools. For info here is the timeline of Etnus https://totalview.io/about \r\n  - https://sources.debian.org/src/openmpi/4.1.0-10/ompi/debuggers/msgq_interface.h/?hl=19#L19\r\n    - See the scan details [msgq_interface.h.scancode.yml.txt](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/files/8649483/msgq_interface.h.scancode.yml.txt)\r\n \r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1120744258/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1206661409","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1292#issuecomment-1206661409","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1292","id":1206661409,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85H7DEh","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXN